    "native_visual_review_evidence": "FC321 native source and regenerated preview review\n\nRead native overview, all overlapping detail00 through detail42 crops, lower source notes and title/revision footer. No unreadable printed character remains. Fixed native seven-column lattice and normal seven-row inclusive block heights verified. Pin letters touch native borders; wedges replace borders. No block shifts applied.\n\nCritical routing: AM restore upper rail c138 to AW.D02; external CCR RESET uses separate lower c138 segment to AW.D04. AZ feedback at c137 reaches AW.D13; AL feedback c136 reaches AX.B05. AZ output turns at c156, joins its upper feedback line at (156,54), and has native diamond (156,82) for BF.D13. Native close feedback strip confirms AL vertical c161 reaches BF.B13; AH CE4 bottom loop c159 reaches BE.B13 and native diamond (159,73); AY c160 passes native diamond (160,68) then turns into BE.D13 at row70. Neighbor rail crossings remain unjoined.\n\nNative detail11 shows AL output rail c84 joins the printed horizontal line at diamond (84,55); BP feedback at (69,55) is a plain bend, not a diamond. Right OR global reset c184 has diamonds at rows40,47,63 and feeds BG.D12, BH.D10, BJ.B09 and BK.B05. Separate switch output rail segments c183 feed BG.D11, BH.B12, BJ.D07 and BK.B03. Parent independently corroborated these center/right rail readings from full-resolution scans. AV.D07 bends down on c133 and joins AZ.D12 at diamond (133,84); separate parity-good input rail c131 reaches AZ.D11.\n\nAll 33 block fields, 50 input terminals, switches and printed hanging page references included. Timing blocks BN/AP/AQ have no inferred outputs. A1 table corroborates every card/socket/portion; no wiring inferred from it. Footer read independently: DATE05-28-70, LOG583, FRAME02, MACH.7201-02, part2584902, SDD BLK BQ; both engineering changes08-08-69 713380 and05-01-70 713674. Requested uppercase P.N. footer label applied. Machine/part values end at239 with blank240 and border241.\n\nCompared regenerated JuliaMono full preview to native overview and close crops, including gate grid labels, pin corners, all diamonds versus crossings, right output names/references, lower feedback loops, native footer and notes. Grid and preview verification flags are true; parent aggregate audit is separate.\n"
